@LS_SCARLET_DESCRIPTION
	;Prints a description of the mode.
HTML_PRINT @"In <font color='%LSScarletColorString%'>Lunatic Survival</font>, you are contracted by the Scarlet Devil Mansion as a personal servant."
PRINTFORMDL However, as your employment begins, the mansion's inhabitants are afflicted with lust and madness.
PRINTFORMDL Those who you serve will prey on you as you try to work.
PRINTL
PRINTFORMDL A number of exclusive interactions and events will be available in this mode.
PRINTFORMDL Unlike the regular game, the objective is to finish your nightly housekeeping tasks before dawn while advancing your own goals.
PRINTFORMDL There are very few events that result from being caught, so there's no need to fail on purpose.
PRINTFORMDL The difficulty is higher, but you will earn a salary and discover other helpful advantages along the way.
PRINTFORMDL Whether you want to escape or remain a slave, you will need to move one room at a time, plan your actions, and avoid wasting the hours.

