		PRINTFORMDW While walking back with your book, you glance around at the rest of the library, wary of meeting anyone else.
		SIF LS_LUNATIC_TIME()
			PRINTFORMDW You didn't notice while Koakuma was leading you earlier, but there's no scarlet light down here.
		PRINTL
	ELSEIF QUEST_FLAG(LSScarletAlias,QLSScarletSameRoundEvent) == 5054
		IF LS_LUNATIC_TIME()
			PRINTFORMDW When she pulls you inside, the first thing you notice is the lack of scarlet.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDW When she pulls you inside, you feel as though all sound and atmosphere has been sucked away.
		ENDIF
	ELSEIF LS_LUNATIC_TIME()
		PRINTFORMDW When you enter the library, the first thing you notice is the lack of scarlet.
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMDW Though the door is at ground level, the floor of this room is in the basement. A small staircase leads down from the entrance.
	PRINTFORMDW All you can see ahead of you are bookshelves upon bookshelves, each one so tall, you'd have to fly to reach even halfway up.
	PRINTFORMDW There are no windows beneath the high ceiling. This may be the only room accessible from above ground where moonlight can't reach.
	PRINTFORMDW The only illumination comes from floating candles high above. Nothing can be heard from within.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDW \@ QUEST_FLAG(LSScarletAlias,QLSScarletSameRoundEvent) == 5054 ? As Flandre leads you # As you wander\@ between the shelves, you come upon an island of light. A candle sits on a crescent-shaped desk in the center of the library.
